1
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:07,800
Long before radar and satellites, the people of this land read the sky… to live.

2
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:17,800
From Suhail's rising they counted the days of the year, and knew the seasons for planting, the sea and rain.

3
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:24,200
From Julfar, Ahmed bin Majid timed his voyages by the monsoon winds and measured star heights in fingers.

4
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,000
Sailors knew every wind by name.

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,600
In Al Ain they shared out the water through the aflaj, and the Founding Father, the late Sheikh Zayed bin Sultan Al Nahyan, restored them.

6
00:00:48,633 --> 00:00:55,033
In 2007 the nation brought its weather service and atmospheric research together in one national center,

7
00:00:56,934 --> 00:01:06,534
which the late Sheikh Khalifa bin Zayed Al Nahyan established by federal decree-law. Today it is the official source of weather information for all seven emirates.

8
00:01:09,433 --> 00:01:11,833
For every flight, a watch that never sleeps;

9
00:01:13,733 --> 00:01:17,133
across the land, warnings of dust and fog;

10
00:01:18,766 --> 00:01:21,466
for every ship, a five-day marine forecast;

11
00:01:23,633 --> 00:01:27,533
for the East Coast, a bulletin that AI drafts and forecasters approve;

12
00:01:28,766 --> 00:01:32,066
for clean energy, forecasts of sunshine and wind.

13
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:52,400
In a land with less than 100 millimetres of rain in a typical year, we sought more rain from the clouds.

14
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Then we invested in the science itself, for the countries facing water scarcity.

15
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:13,800
And today, from the skies of the Emirates to the world,

16
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:21,600
the first President of the World Meteorological Organization from the GCC: His Excellency Dr Abdulla Ahmed Al Mandous.

17
00:02:24,300 --> 00:02:28,200
To the forecasters, observers and seismologists, the pilots, engineers and scientists…

18
00:02:28,900 --> 00:02:31,100
twenty years of watching the sky…

19
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,800
so the nation can plan for tomorrow with confidence.

